e","schema":"fsgg.atlas/1","status":"recorded","summary":"At the audited public defaults, Game's normal package source axis is 0.17.0 and WASM source axis is 0.3.0; Game.Render consumes published UI.Scene/KeyboardInput 0.31.0. Rendering's generated profiles select UI 0.32.2, Game 0.16.0 and Audio 0.6.0. Audio and Net each select their own 0.6.0 axis. FSharp.Core is 10.1.302 in Game and 10.1.401 in Rendering/Audio/Net/Governance. These are immutable source/pin observations, not proven incompatibilities or feed availability. Rendering's local-pack sentinel has a separate purpose, and retaining qualification can intentionally keep older compatible consumer pins. Before migration, check the exact producer/consumer closure and owning accepted evidence instead of demanding all repositories share one version or treating a stale-comment number as the evaluated pin.","supersedes":[],"tags":["game","version","consumer","pin","dependency"],"title":"Component source versions and downstream pins remain separate axes"}
